c=A.u3(A.b(["Step 1: Visit official PM-KISAN portal (pmkisan.gov.in) or visit nearest Common Service Center (CSC).",'Step 2: Click on "Farmers Corner" -> "New Farmer Registration".',"Step 3: Enter Rural/Urban registration, Aadhaar number, Mobile number, and State.","Step 4: Fill land ownership details, survey numbers, and submit for District Nodal Officer verification."],f),d,"Income Support","Central Sector scheme with 100% funding from Government of India to provide income support to all landholding farmer families across the country to enable them to take care of expenses related to agriculture and domestic needs.",e,"scheme_pm_kisan",j,"Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi (PM-KISAN)","Ministry of Agriculture and Farmers Welfare, Govt of India","https://pmkisan.gov.in",c,"Direct financial assistance of \u20b96,000 per year in three equal installments of \u20b92,000.")
