d=A.b(["Very low premium payable by farmer: Max 2% for Kharif food/oilseeds, 1.5% for Rabi, 5% for Annual Commercial/Horticultural crops.","Remaining premium subsidized equally by Central and State Governments.","Coverage for prevented sowing, localized calamities (hailstorm, cloudburst), and mid-season adversity."],f)
