q=A.u3(A.b(["Step 1: Access the National Crop Insurance Portal (pmfby.gov.in) or enroll through bank / CSC.","Step 2: Submit crop insurance proposal before cut-off date for the respective season.","Step 3: Pay the subsidized farmer premium and collect insurance receipt/policy number.","Step 4: In case of crop loss, report within 72 hours via Crop Insurance Mobile App."],f),d,"Insurance","Provides affordable crop insurance coverage to stabilize farmers income against losses caused by droughts, floods, landslides, natural fire, pests, and unseasonal rains.",e,"scheme_pmfby",i,"Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana (PMFBY)","Department of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare","https://pmfby.gov.in",q,"Comprehensive crop insurance against non-preventable natural risks from pre-sowing to post-harvest.")
