d=A.b(["Credit limit up to \u20b93,00,000 at concessional interest rate of 7%.","Additional 3% prompt repayment incentive, reducing effective borrowing cost to just 4% per annum.","Collateral-free agricultural loans up to \u20b91,60,000.","ATM-enabled RuPay Kisan Card for easy withdrawals and input purchases."],f)
p=A.b(["Completed KCC Application Form","Identity & Address Proof (Aadhaar, Voter ID, PAN)","Land holding documents duly verified by revenue authority","Cropping pattern details for the upcoming season"],f)
p=A.u3(A.b(["Step 1: Obtain KCC form from local cooperative bank, commercial bank, or RRB.","Step 2: Fill personal and farm land holding details with proposed cropping plan.","Step 3: Submit to bank branch along with land documents.","Step 4: Bank issues sanctioned limit and RuPay card within 14 days."],f),d,"Credit & Loans","Simplifies credit delivery mechanism to meet short-term credit requirements for cultivation of crops, post-harvest expenses, farm asset maintenance, and allied activities like animal husbandry and fisheries.",e,"scheme_kcc","March 2025","Kisan Credit Card (KCC) Scheme","Reserve Bank of India & NABARD","https://www.nabard.org",p,"Concessional institutional credit at effective 4% interest rate for crop production and allied needs.")
e=A.b(["All categories of farmers with assured water source and agricultural land.","Small and Marginal farmers receive higher subsidy allocation (up to 55%)."],f)
d=A.b(["45% to 55% capital subsidy on Drip and Sprinkler irrigation equipment.","Saves 40-50% water while increasing crop yield by 20-30%.","Enables fertigation to deliver dissolved fertilizers directly to root zones."],f)
